Package: wscreensavers
Version: 1.0.26
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Christopher Patrick Fair <christopherpatrickfair@gmail.com>
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-layer-shell0, libpam0g, xscreensaver (>= 6.0), xvfb, ffmpeg
Description: Native Wayland version of XScreenSaver with live desktop wallpapers
 WScreenSavers is a native Wayland screensaver and live desktop wallpaper
 suite featuring 23 built-in WebGL and Canvas visualizer ports, an XScreenSaver
 XML bridge, PAM-authenticated screen locking, and layer-shell integration
 for Hyprland, Sway, River, and Wayfire.
